The workflow guidance under skills/xforge-* is adapted from OpenSpec's default
workflow skills and schema patterns at commit
e50bd0983dc8dc48250e3181f36e28450542f2ab. It is translated into Chinese and
adapted to XForge's Quick/Solid/Major Stage model, authority boundaries,
work-package protocol, Gates, Evidence, and archive transaction.

